flowchart TD
    Boot([Boot: log + MP4 + threads]):::startend --> VW[VideoWriterThread]:::thread
    Boot --> AW[AnnotateAndWriteThread<br/>drop-newest queue, max 2]:::thread
    Boot --> CT[CameraThread<br/>condition-var + frame_counter]:::thread
    Boot --> DC[DatasetCaptureThread<br/>1 Hz raw JPEGs]:::thread
    Boot --> ST[SensorThread<br/>4-channel ToF poller, 50 Hz]:::thread
    Boot --> IT[ImuThread]:::thread
    ST --> Wait{{Wait sensors_init + imu_init events}}:::sync
    IT --> Wait
    Wait --> DD[/Driving-direction detect:<br/>compare left/right ToF/]:::io
    DD --> Lock[Lock INITIAL_HEADING<br/>motor.forward MOTOR_SPEED]:::action
    Lock --> Loop[Main loop, paced to 60 FPS]:::loop
    Loop --> Frame[get_next_frame prev → blocks until new]:::vision
    Frame --> Read[/sensor_thread.get_readings/]:::io
    Read --> Vision[process_video_frame → detections]:::vision
    Vision --> Turn[Update orange-line turn counter]:::vision
    Turn --> St{State selection<br/>see §4}:::decision
    St --> Clamp[slew ±10 · hard ±40<br/>set_angle only on change]:::control
    Clamp --> Sub[submit frame to AnnotateAndWriteThread]:::action
    Sub --> Loop

